%$	1994/ 7/20  : tree version local pool
%$	1994/ 7/ 5  : comment out debug options
%$      1994/ 6/29  : expand macros
%$      1994/ 4/25  : result yes/no to success/fail
%$      1994/ 2/ 4  : close typeDB after make_lattice
%$      1994/ 2/ 4  : debug print for compile progress
%$      1994/ 1/31  : rename debug tag from cmp to tcmp
%$      1994/ 1/26  : debug#info codes
%$      1994/ 1/25  : close typeDB after tatt in error case
%$      1994/ 1/21  : close typeDB
%$      1994/ 1/18  : unification failure in go_to_mk_lattice
%$      1993/12/24  : latest update
%$      1993/11/18  : begin
